3816 0 obj
  << /ActualText (To design TalentNest effectively\054 both qualitative and quantitative research methods were used to understand user needs and behaviors\056 Qualitative research included user interviews and observations with HR managers\054 recruiters\054 and employees to identify pain points such as manual workflows\054 lack of centralized systems\054 and poor performance tracking\056 Quantitative research involved surveys and data analysis to measure common challenges\054 user preferences\054 and feature priorities across a larger audience\056 Together\054 these insights helped define key problems and guided the design of a user\055centered\054 efficient\054 and scalable talent management platform\056)
     /K [ 104 ]
     /P 3817 0 R
     /Pg 3608 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
