  << /ActualText (The TalentNest platform addresses key challenges in talent management by providing a centralized\054 user\055friendly solution for recruitment\054 employee tracking\054 and performance management\056\050 Through proper user research and UX design\054 the platform focuses on improving efficiency\054 decision\055making\054 and overall user experience\056\050 Ultimately\054 TalentNest helps organizations streamline workflows\054 enhance employee growth\054 and achieve better productivity\056\n)
     /K [ 105 ]
     /P 3819 0 R
     /Pg 3608 0 R
     /S /Span
